# Itkan Automotive Website — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete 4-page corporate website for **Itkan Automotive** (automotive spare parts), inspired by [GSP Europe](https://gsp-europe.com).

### Files Created

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| [index.html](file:///Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website/index.html) | Homepage — hero, products, stats, brands, CTA, footer |
| [about.html](file:///Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website/about.html) | About — company intro, 6 core values, timeline |
| [products.html](file:///Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website/products.html) | Products — 6 detailed category cards |
| [contact.html](file:///Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website/contact.html) | Contact — form + info cards |
| [styles.css](file:///Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website/styles.css) | Full design system (dark theme, red accents) |
| [script.js](file:///Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website/script.js) | Animations, navbar, counters, mobile menu |
| `assets/` | Generated product images and backgrounds |

