## Design Features

- **Dark industrial theme** with black/dark-gray backgrounds and red (#e63946) accents
- **Outfit + Inter** premium typography via Google Fonts
- **Scroll-reveal animations** via IntersectionObserver
- **Animated number counters** in the Key Figures section
- **Brand marquee** with continuous infinite scroll for 16 car brands
- **Glassmorphism** sticky navbar with backdrop blur on scroll
- **Responsive layout** — mobile, tablet, and desktop breakpoints
- **Hover micro-animations** on all cards and buttons

## Running Locally

```bash
cd /Users/rayen/Documents/Projects/website
npx -y http-server ./ -p 8080
```

Then open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) in your browser.
